title: "Rare diseases in Mexico: analysis code (Enfermedades raras en México: código de análisis)"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jpgr70-dev/enfermedades-raras-mexico"
url: "https://github.com/jpgr70-dev/enfermedades-raras-mexico"
abstract: "R code to estimate the cumulative point prevalence of rare diseases in Mexico from Orphanet, and to analyze the geographic distribution, in-hospital mortality and length of stay of hospital discharges and deaths with ICD-10 codes that potentially correspond to rare diseases, Mexico 2014-2024. Raw data are public and are not redistributed."
keywords:
  - rare diseases
  - Mexico
  - Orphanet
  - hospital discharges
  - R
